# Files that must NOT be pushed into the Apps Script project.
#
# Only matters if you adopt clasp (`clasp push`). There is no .clasp.json in
# this repository today — files are copied into the editor by hand — but this
# sits here so that the day someone does run `clasp push`, the developer tools
# and the documentation do not land in the Apps Script project alongside the
# application.
#
# clasp pushes everything that is NOT matched here.

# Node scripts that read this repo as text. They use require() and __dirname,
# which do not exist in Apps Script, and tools/dep.js declares a global called
# DEP_MAP that would clobber the real one in Deployment_Check.gs.
tools/**

# Prose. Nothing here is code.
docs/**
README.md
**/README.md

# Repository metadata.
.git/**
.gitignore
.claspignore
